{"id": "clm:7c8cbec98adaccb96d5b2c38f996acb725a75cb8ea88e81f419e2040f3c38aaf", "type": "statement", "text": "setOnInsert applies only when an upsert inserts a document; the documented invocation passes new UpdateOptions().upsert(true). (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/builders/updates.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:909b3f025af719fafb94b974190f32f21b303f23fc6c6ce1f1967995bf1bebfe"]}
{"id": "clm:ca5b0529426d634a8454f92c62e3cb45bcf7a439b3a10afcf7aa6c8fff905897", "type": "statement", "text": "Configure a POJO collection by combining the default codec registry with a PojoCodecProvider registry, applying it to the database or collection, and passing the POJO class to getCollection(). (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/document-data-format-pojo.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "how-to", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:d9176bc46694e628146ecdbf8e47b71835c78d84989e435592d0be44015350de", "ev:ea862809ef8f60bc4c928a0b20677297bcab02ff822281db4d43e4dd24eee3de"]}
{"id": "clm:c61732e1db77e221332a768390cf327844fdc841774da799a6b619d4dd5e0cd2", "type": "statement", "text": "JAVA-6138 reports that generic hierarchy serialization that worked in 5.5.x failed in 5.6.x with a CodecConfigurationException for java.lang.Object while encoding a Map<String, Object> property. Treat this as a version-specific reported regression rather than a universal POJO limitation. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/JAVA-6138", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:9ec55a50179ece15bb8cc826e31ea7a3edd16544ca8cc5451dc0ab855a4bf3b9"]}
{"id": "clm:d53a0199f010bf8c75d4d04b38b09a17a172c475e0f548c315529b81f7502833", "type": "statement", "text": "Filters provides static factories that produce BSON query filters usable by find, update and delete methods; the POJO CRUD example also uses Filters.lte and Filters.eq. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/builders/filters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/document-data-format-pojo.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1d71c337be0afc9cdea96e43dcfb704c81078aa633b55bfe3accdcc777af9010", "ev:abd3cc4d9240f4638e4346ce47e5236618aeda00c84cb186bacca5b3a420f595", "ev:de5a5cc91fca0ebcfdb0143cff1c039e21349048219b6a2c2f04de500df705f1"]}
{"id": "clm:f5808c0e2d85841eeb70ae8452e49a13ebe5c624a5b7a244ab310a6c8589c0cf", "type": "statement", "text": "Filters supplies comparison helpers including eq, gt, gte, lt, lte, in and nin, plus logical and/or composition. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/builders/filters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b4c1125f668cd93b87d84924365d734eb34e5b3d88678494199cf4c9effee005", "ev:f12d5d1908bcec7bd63ae4887a42e18bee8349d3c8b212292e01be3ba4d477bc"]}
{"id": "clm:e70ec0081fe016269257fefbfca75cf02ebb11b33af4b39fce88215a69e194f1", "type": "statement", "text": "Automatic POJO mapping follows JavaBean getter/setter conventions and can access public fields directly. Quarkus independently documents the same PojoCodecProvider field/accessor model. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/document-data-format-pojo.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://quarkus.io/guides/mongodb-panache"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0893f876c26d6f66bd69c3230faa267f8eac74c34cdb1a1f1e8320bc4e5bdf99", "ev:c667212d1a99ce51e23460919ea6dae27b6ed917bc24a2f8fcb5aea27fd5c68c"]}
{"id": "clm:eab252ebc6443b3b18ee3478ff47f292d9459e1be0fdcf0bdeff6217d3aad673", "type": "statement", "text": "BsonProperty customizes the BSON field name, BsonId selects the identifier property, and BsonIgnore controls whether a property is serialized or deserialized. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://quarkus.io/guides/mongodb-panache"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4781c908858d6ba56b11f8a8eb56c6a762fff19c83e707e8cc7449999be58d34"]}
{"id": "clm:f1ef91104426273788af40caa2b496258f12ab89aae3c2e5f9ebbdbd70c5a43e", "type": "statement", "text": "POJO codecs call an empty no-argument constructor by default. With annotation conventions enabled, BsonCreator selects a different constructor or public static creator; constructor parameters require BsonProperty or BsonId annotations. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:a1b7f53561215fb0dd20cf7ce8c00aaf8bb616e436034084ab9d18e95648a575", "ev:cea53c33855434f235fc39ea105bb197de1d19bebbb65e5836f053f3206dd1f5"]}
{"id": "clm:241ed63ceb92555f3d5f37dbb33916450d48143b59f33d2e48e1e97eaba4221b", "type": "statement", "text": "Generic POJO properties require concrete bounded type parameters. ClassModelBuilder retains concrete type information to work around erasure; PropertyCodecProvider permits custom handling of generic property types. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0695d9a98cfadf5a1916cd23f07ad5635134b097ec8648a98ef78372182e5d05"]}
{"id": "clm:79f8074a6696f2ac9aa17098703b8b84880c9917bff0aa6106dc103dfaa79cd9", "type": "statement", "text": "Since driver 4.5 the PojoCodecProvider no longer supplies enum conversion itself; include an enum codec such as the default registry provider. Codec registries use precedence order, so a custom enum codec can be placed before the default registry. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/codecs.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:09595945de80bd045ca5ea6d766355b9ce42b5ff69d921307efa321bbf68bf49", "ev:1caf213e1e8172d6b0fd580d81c18765d0caec47422eefe1d1576901d2a8415e"]}
{"id": "clm:01c97b7795c09402c976ebe94059e7018833e3d344ee693ad74cfc403f42ad6a", "type": "statement", "text": "The Java sync driver uses filter builders for find, update and delete predicates; the POJO CRUD example uses Filters with updateOne and deleteOne. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/builders/filters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/document-data-format-pojo.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:626a70137c8b89531a6c236042fd8bed09c92fb7323ff7543ff5bb767bcd35ca", "ev:6ac02ff2d79eb5bd14672a6831bb965d8956a9b5e29fea05ff0477e1952bc515"]}
{"id": "clm:ef9386286f3428789aee3dd720bf411f6ddbe4bccb2fae95211fd13cde3de9e3", "type": "statement", "text": "Compose predicates with and or or; eq tests equality, and an empty filter matches all documents. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/builders/filters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:000a06ff5c421f38a64f7f5cbc8e4bdd9cf4549fdec51fe6b0c33c74df27089b", "ev:75587fcfbc82c9de8ac78dca27a417382b106022bc6de39adafbff19e38f2508", "ev:a2a97fea507050b65614d3b48525dfd8a6d3487dcbcb196779915d3ebce1870e"]}
{"id": "clm:49611bcbf4c1a041de3e8258e4df4870ed053a5750363494a1bfa8666ee03b1f", "type": "statement", "text": "PojoCodecProvider can use automatic(true) for predefined POJO conversion; explicit registration supports individual classes, packages and ClassModel instances. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/document-data-format-pojo.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:648adfa634bc65f45e8f92cb7ac00b7cfefcaafd5a1cc55eba2359cb284889b4", "ev:fded669afa866ec7f1b928907218816864d2c59240e7a0a13a377a3b4320d173"]}
