{"id": "clm:3511ee47ade931e09e3228002828d8732b19aff410f55f388ec6a3cd340c0c27", "type": "statement", "text": "For a POJO property declared as an abstract class or interface, the customization guide requires discriminators on that type and its subtypes or implementations. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/java/sync/current/data-formats/pojo-customization.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Java sync driver CRUD, Filters/Updates builders and POJO codecs"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:09a8ed60a0dd3c36a00da1b50a0297e40413cda6c5ab8228033ecac447d197c4", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:fc9bc90e2798831170969d08eab7859b84a4aecdf54f6cd95d513c4dcc35f6b1"]}
